  "name": "Bran Muffins with Applesauce",
  "subtitle": "Tender whole-grain muffins with a lightly sweet bran crumb",
  "description": "Applesauce, wheat bran, and ground flax make these simple muffins moist and hearty for breakfast or brunch.",
